WEBVTT

00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:09.550
Confirm It With a Fist!

00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:09.550
Dad's Feelings

00:00:06.250 --> 00:00:08.000
Confirm It With a Fist!

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:09.550
Dad's Feelings!

00:00:29.040 --> 00:00:30.420
Dad!

00:00:30.420 --> 00:00:32.070
See you! {Splash: CHIBI tte rofl}

00:00:32.430 --> 00:00:34.740
Take care!

00:00:41.610 --> 00:00:43.300
Yoshino! Yoshino!

00:00:43.300 --> 00:00:43.930
Wake up!

00:00:43.930 --> 00:00:45.110
Yoshino!

00:00:46.450 --> 00:00:47.890
I see...

00:00:47.890 --> 00:00:49.960
We're back in the human world...

00:00:51.850 --> 00:00:53.370
Were we...

00:00:53.370 --> 00:00:55.110
Were we saved?

00:01:04.750 --> 00:01:05.980
Who are you?

00:01:05.980 --> 00:01:08.270
Why did you help us?

00:01:09.160 --> 00:01:11.380
My name is Sleipmon.

00:01:11.380 --> 00:01:12.980
I am one of the Royal Knights.

00:01:13.150 --> 00:01:22.990
Sleipmon

00:01:13.150 --> 00:01:22.990
Ultimate Level

00:01:13.830 --> 00:01:15.030
Sleipmon.

00:01:15.030 --> 00:01:18.760
An Ultimate Level Digimon whose body is entirely covered with Red Digizoid armor.

00:01:18.760 --> 00:01:22.990
His special attack is Odin's Breath, which generates an icy cold blizzard.

00:01:24.210 --> 00:01:26.160
No need to worry.

00:01:26.520 --> 00:01:28.330
He is on our side.

00:01:28.770 --> 00:01:30.300
Captain Satsuma?!

00:01:34.620 --> 00:01:36.890
<i>CAPTAIN!</i>

00:01:37.490 --> 00:01:39.070
It's a relief to see you alive!

00:01:39.070 --> 00:01:40.830
Then that must mean this is...

00:01:43.100 --> 00:01:44.240
Kudamon!

00:01:44.240 --> 00:01:48.060
Sleipmon was Kudamon's evolved form!

00:01:48.060 --> 00:01:51.590
I'm sorry... for worrying all of you...

00:01:52.410 --> 00:01:53.320
Kudamon!

00:01:54.850 --> 00:01:56.600
Let's hurry back to the shelter!

00:01:56.600 --> 00:01:59.130
Aniki, let's go, too!

00:01:59.770 --> 00:02:00.570
Aniki?

00:02:03.010 --> 00:02:04.220
Aniki...

00:03:06.350 --> 00:03:09.760
Kudamon, as an emissary of the Digital World,

00:03:09.760 --> 00:03:12.740
has been keeping watch over the human world all this time.

00:03:12.740 --> 00:03:19.970
He was to determine whether or not the human beings were a beneficial existence to the Digimon.

00:03:19.970 --> 00:03:21.070
So that means...

00:03:21.410 --> 00:03:24.740
Kudamon was Yggdrasil's spy?!

00:03:24.740 --> 00:03:26.420
Calm down, Megumi.

00:03:28.270 --> 00:03:32.220
It's true that I am one of the Royal Knights.

00:03:32.220 --> 00:03:35.010
But, during my stay here in the human world,

00:03:35.010 --> 00:03:39.430
I have grown fond of you humans.

00:03:40.320 --> 00:03:43.220
Although he means to save the Digital World,

00:03:43.220 --> 00:03:49.680
I cannot accept Yggdrasil's command to erase the human world from existence.

00:03:49.890 --> 00:03:52.060
<i>The ones who destroyed the dimensional barrier</i>

00:03:52.060 --> 00:03:57.070
<i>and who are leading the two worlds to their destruction are none other than the humans.</i>

00:03:57.070 --> 00:03:59.570
<i>There is no worth in keeping the humans alive.</i>

00:04:00.600 --> 00:04:02.830
<i>The human world...</i>

00:04:02.830 --> 00:04:04.280
<i>will be destroyed.</i>

00:04:05.020 --> 00:04:06.750
Yggdrasil is...

00:04:06.750 --> 00:04:08.870
the God of the Digital World, right?

00:04:09.430 --> 00:04:10.970
Masaru...

00:04:10.970 --> 00:04:11.910
Why...

00:04:12.840 --> 00:04:15.620
Why is Dad calling himself Yggdrasil?

00:04:16.220 --> 00:04:18.840
Why did he become our enemy?

00:04:18.840 --> 00:04:19.920
Why?!

00:04:22.030 --> 00:04:23.410
That man...

00:04:23.410 --> 00:04:25.850
Professor Daimon has changed.

00:04:27.550 --> 00:04:32.210
After we escaped from the space-time interval and landed in the Digital World,

00:04:32.210 --> 00:04:34.470
we met Professor Daimon.

00:04:34.770 --> 00:04:35.810
What?

00:04:35.810 --> 00:04:37.060
You're going to erase the human world?!

00:04:38.130 --> 00:04:42.400
This is what I have decided as the God of the Digital World.

00:04:42.400 --> 00:04:45.760
Nothing can change my mind.

00:04:45.760 --> 00:04:49.170
Then what about Sayuri-san and Chika-chan?!

00:04:49.170 --> 00:04:52.040
What about Masaru, who is fighting for both the humans and the Digimon?!

00:04:52.380 --> 00:04:55.110
I have no concern for them.

00:04:55.110 --> 00:04:55.950
Begone.

00:04:58.550 --> 00:05:02.020
The father you knew no longer exists.

00:05:02.020 --> 00:05:02.880
That man...

00:05:03.480 --> 00:05:05.970
Professor Daimon Suguru has changed!

00:05:13.160 --> 00:05:14.600
Ch-Chika!

00:05:17.370 --> 00:05:18.240
That's a lie!

00:05:18.240 --> 00:05:19.350
You're lying!

00:05:20.580 --> 00:05:21.510
Chika...

00:05:25.620 --> 00:05:27.050
Family, huh...?

00:05:27.050 --> 00:05:28.860
I hope they're all okay...{Splash: Eat some more, Ikuto~}

00:05:42.300 --> 00:05:44.040
About these fried eggs...

00:05:44.040 --> 00:05:46.090
These belong to Aniki!

00:05:46.090 --> 00:05:48.440
I-I wasn't going to ask you to give them to me or anything!

00:05:48.440 --> 00:05:50.800
E-Er, so... oh yeah, about Masaru!

00:05:50.800 --> 00:05:52.480
You don't have to worry about Masaru at all!

00:05:52.480 --> 00:05:54.350
He'll turn back into his cheerful self right away!

00:05:54.830 --> 00:05:56.440
I didn't ask for your opinion.

00:05:56.440 --> 00:05:59.460
Aniki's not the type to get discouraged from this.

00:06:01.310 --> 00:06:03.070
Listen up, everyone.

00:06:03.770 --> 00:06:09.680
As you are already aware, both Earth and the Digital World are on the brink of a collision.

00:06:09.680 --> 00:06:14.000
People around the world have been instructed to take refuge in underground shelters,

00:06:14.000 --> 00:06:17.240
but unfortunately, it's merely lip comfort.

00:06:17.240 --> 00:06:19.990
When BanchouLeomon runs out of energy,

00:06:19.990 --> 00:06:22.770
both worlds will ram into each other.

00:06:23.520 --> 00:06:24.720
That's why...

00:06:24.720 --> 00:06:29.610
I'd like each and every one of you to consider what actions you should take from now on.

00:06:29.610 --> 00:06:31.960
That's all I have to say.

00:06:31.960 --> 00:06:33.890
What will you do, Captain?

00:06:34.430 --> 00:06:37.260
I'll look for a way to save this world.

00:06:37.260 --> 00:06:40.100
Kudamon and I will search together until the very last moment.

00:06:40.840 --> 00:06:42.940
What we should do from now on...

00:06:43.540 --> 00:06:44.370
Captain!

00:06:44.370 --> 00:06:46.650
There's a Digimon signal in the northeast harbor area!

00:06:47.110 --> 00:06:48.150
What?

00:06:48.920 --> 00:06:51.070
Judging from this magnitude, it can't be...!

00:06:53.960 --> 00:06:58.250
Dad is the God of this Digital World that's falling down on us.

00:06:59.470 --> 00:07:04.500
He wants to get rid of our world to save the Digital World...

00:07:04.500 --> 00:07:10.840
Does Dad not care about us... about his family anymore?

00:07:11.450 --> 00:07:13.700
But we were always waiting for him...

00:07:13.700 --> 00:07:17.720
I always believed that... Dad would come back to us one day...

00:07:18.650 --> 00:07:23.180
No matter how lonely it felt, I was waiting for him all this time...

00:07:23.180 --> 00:07:24.820
So why...?

00:07:24.820 --> 00:07:27.190
It's gotta be some kind of a mistake!

00:07:27.660 --> 00:07:30.510
There's no way Dad would betray us!

00:07:30.510 --> 00:07:32.860
I'm sure he has a reason!

00:07:33.280 --> 00:07:35.320
If he doesn't, then...

00:07:37.440 --> 00:07:38.950
Masaru.

00:07:38.950 --> 00:07:43.790
I don't know what happened between you and Suguru-san over there.

00:07:45.120 --> 00:07:50.340
But no matter how Suguru-san appeared to you when you met him...

00:07:50.720 --> 00:07:53.950
I believe in him.

00:07:53.950 --> 00:07:57.430
After all, we're his family.

00:07:57.430 --> 00:07:58.510
Family...

00:07:58.930 --> 00:08:02.520
Keeping faith in each other, no matter how hard it gets, is what a family does.

00:08:06.610 --> 00:08:08.520
I want to believe in him, too!

00:08:09.360 --> 00:08:09.900
But...

00:08:13.200 --> 00:08:15.880
After seeing Dad like that...

00:08:15.880 --> 00:08:17.870
just what am I supposed to do now?!

00:08:18.260 --> 00:08:21.410
Damn it!

00:08:30.870 --> 00:08:32.740
Wait, Dukemon!

00:08:36.490 --> 00:08:39.420
I knew you'd be alive, Kudamon.

00:08:39.420 --> 00:08:42.020
Leave the human world alone!

00:08:42.530 --> 00:08:47.350
Yggdrasil has ordered us to eliminate the human world.

00:08:47.350 --> 00:08:51.440
We Royal Knights must fulfill the mission he has given us.

00:08:51.910 --> 00:08:54.300
I understand that it is for the sake of the Digital World's survival,

00:08:54.300 --> 00:08:57.910
but sacrificing multitudes of innocent people cannot be reasonable!

00:08:58.270 --> 00:09:00.030
That's an odd thing to say.

00:09:00.030 --> 00:09:04.910
It was the humans who first killed innocent Digimon.

00:09:05.230 --> 00:09:06.170
No!

00:09:06.170 --> 00:09:07.870
The only one bad here is Kurata!

00:09:07.870 --> 00:09:10.250
Not all humans are bad!

00:09:10.770 --> 00:09:14.910
Unfortunately, Yggdrasil does not think so.

00:09:15.990 --> 00:09:17.460
Step aside!

00:09:17.460 --> 00:09:21.350
If not, I shall dispatch of you right now, along with the ground you stand on!

00:09:21.660 --> 00:09:23.870
Don't think you can get away with it!

00:09:23.870 --> 00:09:26.060
We will protect this world!

00:09:29.450 --> 00:09:31.270
Digisoul Charge!

00:09:29.450 --> 00:09:31.270
Digisoul Charge!

00:09:31.270 --> 00:09:32.700
Overdrive!

00:09:31.270 --> 00:09:32.700
Overdrive!

00:09:33.480 --> 00:09:34.770
Gaomon, evolve!

00:09:34.770 --> 00:09:36.240
Lalamon, evolve!

00:09:36.240 --> 00:09:37.790
Falcomon, evolve!

00:09:48.990 --> 00:09:51.040
MirageGaogamon!

00:10:02.810 --> 00:10:04.060
Rosemon!

00:10:12.770 --> 00:10:14.070
Ravemon!

00:10:17.140 --> 00:10:18.290
Digisoul...

00:10:17.140 --> 00:10:18.290
Digisoul...

00:10:18.900 --> 00:10:20.140
Full Charge!

00:10:18.900 --> 00:10:20.140
Full Charge!

00:10:20.790 --> 00:10:22.700
PawnChessmon, evolve!

00:10:20.790 --> 00:10:22.700
PawnChessmon, evolve!

00:10:22.700 --> 00:10:23.870
RookChessmon!

00:10:23.870 --> 00:10:25.200
BishopChessmon!

00:10:27.320 --> 00:10:28.890
You again.

00:10:28.890 --> 00:10:32.880
I thought I'd already shown you the difference of our abilities in our last battle.

00:10:33.310 --> 00:10:36.350
We're not afraid of defeat!

00:10:36.350 --> 00:10:38.880
We just want to protect those who are important to us!

00:10:40.330 --> 00:10:41.340
Fools.

00:10:44.050 --> 00:10:45.120
Aniki!

00:10:45.120 --> 00:10:46.310
We have trouble!

00:10:46.770 --> 00:10:48.650
Aniki!

00:10:53.350 --> 00:10:55.170
<i>See you!</i>

00:10:55.170 --> 00:10:56.440
<i>Dad!</i>

00:10:56.440 --> 00:10:58.030
<i>Bye!</i>

00:10:58.470 --> 00:11:00.490
<i>Take care!</i>

00:11:01.310 --> 00:11:02.900
Dad...

00:11:02.900 --> 00:11:03.630
Masaru?

00:11:05.910 --> 00:11:07.540
No, nothing.

00:11:08.890 --> 00:11:09.860
Mom.

00:11:11.700 --> 00:11:16.130
Do you remember the day when Dad left for the Digital World?

00:11:16.470 --> 00:11:17.600
Of course.

00:11:17.600 --> 00:11:19.470
I'll never forget it.

00:11:19.470 --> 00:11:22.270
It was on an evening just like today.

00:11:22.270 --> 00:11:22.800
Yeah.

00:11:23.230 --> 00:11:26.810
We didn't have this thing hanging above our heads back then, though.

00:11:31.500 --> 00:11:32.490
Take that!

00:11:36.320 --> 00:11:38.660
Before Dad left for his trip that day...

00:11:37.800 --> 00:11:38.610
There!

00:11:38.660 --> 00:11:41.670
the two of us played catch one last time.

00:11:41.670 --> 00:11:43.280
That's when I said...

00:11:43.650 --> 00:11:44.800
Dad!

00:11:44.800 --> 00:11:46.740
Throw it at me with all you've got this time!

00:11:50.290 --> 00:11:52.140
I'll definitely show you I can catch it!

00:12:04.080 --> 00:12:04.900
Masaru...

00:12:13.930 --> 00:12:14.940
All right.

00:12:14.940 --> 00:12:15.440
Here it comes!

00:12:29.970 --> 00:12:30.950
Check it out!

00:12:31.340 --> 00:12:33.100
That's terrific, Masaru!

00:12:34.430 --> 00:12:38.780
And so, I caught the ball that Dad threw with all of his might.

00:12:40.540 --> 00:12:41.400
Masaru.

00:12:44.950 --> 00:12:45.680
You can have this.

00:12:52.460 --> 00:12:53.850
You're giving this to me?!

00:12:54.360 --> 00:12:55.880
Wow!

00:12:57.340 --> 00:12:58.310
Masaru.

00:12:58.750 --> 00:12:59.940
This pendant...

00:12:59.940 --> 00:13:02.070
is proof of a grown man.

00:13:02.650 --> 00:13:04.860
A grown man?

00:13:05.590 --> 00:13:09.350
Suguru-san looked incredibly happy that time.

00:13:09.350 --> 00:13:13.700
He must have felt relieved that even if he didn't return from the Digital World,

00:13:13.700 --> 00:13:16.000
you would protect the family for him, Masaru.

00:13:17.020 --> 00:13:20.030
He must have had faith you could do it.

00:13:21.820 --> 00:13:23.270
That's right.

00:13:23.270 --> 00:13:26.200
Dad believed in me.

00:13:26.200 --> 00:13:28.830
That's why I need to believe in him too, now.

00:13:32.040 --> 00:13:32.600
What's that?

00:13:34.300 --> 00:13:35.250
Get down!

00:13:40.270 --> 00:13:41.280
BishopChessmon!

00:13:41.280 --> 00:13:43.030
Aniki!

00:13:43.030 --> 00:13:45.110
A Royal Knight is attacking us!

00:13:45.110 --> 00:13:46.340
What?

00:13:51.220 --> 00:13:52.190
He's...!

00:13:52.740 --> 00:13:55.590
Aniki! Let's hurry up and beat that guy!

00:13:55.590 --> 00:13:56.290
Yeah!

00:13:56.840 --> 00:13:58.840
Mom, Chika, get someplace safe!

00:13:59.740 --> 00:14:00.710
Let's go, Agumon!

00:14:00.710 --> 00:14:01.490
Follow me!

00:14:01.490 --> 00:14:02.250
Okay!

00:14:17.960 --> 00:14:21.080
I wondered how much strength you possessed

00:14:21.080 --> 00:14:23.920
to have given Craniummon difficulty,

00:14:23.920 --> 00:14:28.690
but now I see you wish to defy the Royal Knights with this level of power?

00:14:28.690 --> 00:14:30.510
Don't make me laugh!

00:14:33.440 --> 00:14:34.980
You are finished.

00:14:34.980 --> 00:14:36.620
I shall put an end to this once and for all!

00:14:36.620 --> 00:14:38.040
I won't let you!

00:14:39.100 --> 00:14:40.210
We'll take you on!

00:14:41.110 --> 00:14:41.830
Masaru!

00:14:50.690 --> 00:14:52.630
Digisoul Charge!

00:14:52.630 --> 00:14:53.850
Overdrive!

00:14:55.030 --> 00:14:56.620
Agumon, evolve!

00:15:08.340 --> 00:15:09.940
ShineGreymon!

00:15:10.330 --> 00:15:11.790
Let's go!

00:15:11.790 --> 00:15:13.620
GeoGrey Sword!

00:15:34.420 --> 00:15:38.260
Not only did a human divert my attention with his Digisoul...

00:15:38.260 --> 00:15:41.140
but you've made me wield my Gram against you.

00:15:41.140 --> 00:15:42.500
Very well.

00:15:42.500 --> 00:15:43.850
I shall take you on!

00:15:44.200 --> 00:15:45.120
Come forth!

00:16:15.990 --> 00:16:16.970
Take this!

00:16:16.970 --> 00:16:18.820
Glorious Burst!

00:16:22.130 --> 00:16:23.150
ShineGreymon!

00:16:26.930 --> 00:16:29.270
Attacking desperately will only get you so far.

00:16:29.270 --> 00:16:34.450
You think you can smash through my armor with that feeble force of yours?

00:16:34.710 --> 00:16:35.860
Damn it!

00:16:35.860 --> 00:16:37.340
Stand up, ShineGreymon!

00:16:38.360 --> 00:16:39.030
It's useless!

00:16:40.100 --> 00:16:42.220
No matter how many times you face me,

00:16:42.220 --> 00:16:45.220
you are all powerless before my defense!

00:16:45.220 --> 00:16:46.430
Shut up!

00:16:46.890 --> 00:16:49.470
We're going to take you down!

00:16:49.470 --> 00:16:51.590
I won't let you destroy the human world!

00:16:51.910 --> 00:16:55.230
And then, I'm going to confirm my dad's real feelings!

00:16:55.230 --> 00:16:59.230
Dad just can't be the kind of man who makes innocent people suffer!

00:16:59.230 --> 00:16:59.890
Masaru...

00:17:00.300 --> 00:17:02.960
You humans are free to mutter your nonsense,

00:17:02.960 --> 00:17:06.230
but I shall not overlook anyone who insults Yggdrasil!

00:17:06.230 --> 00:17:08.220
This shall be your final resting place!

00:17:09.500 --> 00:17:11.020
Satsuma, let me evolve.

00:17:11.020 --> 00:17:13.070
But with your injuries...

00:17:13.360 --> 00:17:14.820
Now is not the time to be worrying about that!

00:17:15.990 --> 00:17:16.530
Hurry!

00:17:17.840 --> 00:17:19.500
Final Elysian!

00:17:20.630 --> 00:17:22.660
Digisoul Charge!

00:17:22.660 --> 00:17:23.700
Overdrive!

00:17:24.780 --> 00:17:26.210
Kudamon, evolve!

00:17:27.820 --> 00:17:29.000
Sleipmon!

00:17:31.950 --> 00:17:32.500
What?

00:17:35.170 --> 00:17:36.240
Sleipmon!

00:17:40.530 --> 00:17:43.770
You plan to fight me with that wounded body?

00:17:44.460 --> 00:17:45.640
Why?

00:17:45.640 --> 00:17:49.920
Why do you, a Royal Knight, side with the humans?!

00:17:50.910 --> 00:17:57.200
Just as Yggdrasil has said, humans may be foolish and arrogant beings.

00:17:57.530 --> 00:17:58.580
But...

00:17:58.580 --> 00:18:01.370
They have the ability to mend their ways.

00:18:02.050 --> 00:18:05.120
They can evolve just like us!

00:18:05.800 --> 00:18:08.680
I have faith in the human beings' potential!

00:18:18.610 --> 00:18:20.580
Stand down, Sleipmon!

00:18:20.580 --> 00:18:23.890
It will do me no honor to defeat you!

00:18:24.510 --> 00:18:26.340
How nonchalant you are, Dukemon.

00:18:26.340 --> 00:18:27.810
But how will you fare against this?

00:18:28.660 --> 00:18:29.990
Odin's Breath!

00:18:37.850 --> 00:18:38.800
You...!

00:18:39.760 --> 00:18:40.960
Now, Dukemon!

00:18:40.960 --> 00:18:43.030
You shall freeze to death along with me!

00:18:49.700 --> 00:18:52.090
I won't let you have your way!

00:18:54.810 --> 00:18:57.130
Let's see whether we both end up freezing to death...

00:18:57.130 --> 00:19:01.000
or whether your Gram pierces through my Niflheim first!

00:19:01.000 --> 00:19:02.540
We shall see which is faster!

00:19:03.940 --> 00:19:05.050
Sleipmon!

00:19:05.420 --> 00:19:06.520
Satsuma!

00:19:06.520 --> 00:19:07.540
Masaru!

00:19:07.540 --> 00:19:10.000
I will entrust to you humans...

00:19:10.000 --> 00:19:12.230
the future of the two worlds!

00:19:17.930 --> 00:19:18.530
Sleipmon!

00:19:18.840 --> 00:19:19.860
Sleipmon!

00:19:33.420 --> 00:19:35.980
I'm going to the Digital World.

00:19:35.980 --> 00:19:38.350
I have to make sure of Dad's true feelings.

00:19:38.350 --> 00:19:39.510
Be careful.

00:19:39.930 --> 00:19:41.330
Masaru-niichan.

00:19:41.330 --> 00:19:42.350
Don't worry.

00:19:42.350 --> 00:19:43.590
I have this.

00:19:44.360 --> 00:19:46.000
Man-to-man.

00:19:46.000 --> 00:19:49.890
If we talk through fists, we can express what's in both of our hearts!

00:19:50.520 --> 00:19:54.570
I'll uncover everything that Dad's thinking about, by all means.

00:19:54.570 --> 00:19:55.930
Masaru-niichan!

00:19:55.930 --> 00:19:57.280
I'll be fine!

00:19:57.280 --> 00:19:58.290
Don't worry about me.

00:19:59.580 --> 00:20:01.660
Masaru-niichan, promise!

00:20:01.660 --> 00:20:04.300
Promise me that you'll bring Dad back home!

00:20:04.300 --> 00:20:06.130
Yeah, I promise!

00:20:06.130 --> 00:20:06.950
Masaru!

00:20:07.540 --> 00:20:09.020
I'll go with you.

00:20:09.020 --> 00:20:10.410
Us, too!

00:20:10.880 --> 00:20:13.420
No, ShineGreymon and I will go alone.

00:20:13.420 --> 00:20:14.940
How can you say that?

00:20:14.940 --> 00:20:18.370
You know how strong the Royal Knights really are!

00:20:18.370 --> 00:20:20.570
This is a matter between me and my dad.

00:20:20.570 --> 00:20:21.470
Please.

00:20:21.470 --> 00:20:23.010
Let me do this alone.

00:20:23.010 --> 00:20:24.350
Masaru...

00:20:24.350 --> 00:20:25.560
Besides,

00:20:25.560 --> 00:20:28.950
the Royal Knights are trying to eliminate the human world.

00:20:28.950 --> 00:20:33.200
If we all went to the Digital World, who'll be left to defend this place?

00:20:35.010 --> 00:20:35.930
Okay.

00:20:35.930 --> 00:20:37.290
Go, Masaru!

00:20:38.130 --> 00:20:42.390
Mercurimon and I understood each other after I went to talk to him.

00:20:42.390 --> 00:20:45.380
That's why you go and talk to your father, Masaru!

00:20:45.380 --> 00:20:46.120
Okay!

00:20:46.820 --> 00:20:47.990
Good grief...

00:20:48.730 --> 00:20:51.290
You're never persuaded otherwise once you've made up your mind.

00:20:52.020 --> 00:20:53.160
Make sure you come back.

00:20:53.590 --> 00:20:54.930
Yoshino.

00:20:54.930 --> 00:20:56.380
Thank you.

00:20:56.380 --> 00:20:57.630
Go, Masaru.

00:20:57.980 --> 00:20:59.220
Tohma.

00:20:59.220 --> 00:21:03.420
We'll make sure to protect this place until you've reached your goal.

00:21:03.940 --> 00:21:06.140
You'll have a place to return home to.

00:21:07.150 --> 00:21:08.670
Leave it to us!

00:21:08.670 --> 00:21:09.370
Okay!

00:21:11.120 --> 00:21:12.430
I'm counting on you, guys!

00:21:17.620 --> 00:21:18.720
Masaru.

00:21:19.100 --> 00:21:21.720
Both I and everyone else...

00:21:21.720 --> 00:21:23.370
We all believe in you.

00:21:24.340 --> 00:21:25.540
You can do it.

00:21:26.340 --> 00:21:28.260
Just wait, Dad!

00:21:28.260 --> 00:21:31.370
This time, I'll make sure you tell me your true feelings!

